{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":480261,"name":"Tamas King","username":"Tamas_King","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/tamas_king/{size}/119483_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-01T16:33:58.404Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-480261-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-480261-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-480261-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-480261-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003cbr\u003e\nI’m experiencing what appears to be the same issue others have reported with Grok Bot becoming stuck and failing to respond.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI have already:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRestarted my computer.\u003cbr\u003e\nConfirmed Cursor is up to date.\u003cbr\u003e\nCreated a fresh copy of the affected Grok Bot.\u003cbr\u003e\nTested the new copy with a very simple health check that uses no tools, connectors, search, or memory.\u003cbr\u003e\nThe issue persists. The bot repeatedly returns “Bot failed to respond — Something went wrong while generating the reply. Try again.” even in the newly created copy.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOther Grok Bots also appear to be affected, so this does not seem isolated to a single conversation or bot configuration.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCould someone please confirm whether this is a known Grok Bot service issue and advise on any troubleshooting steps or information/logs I can provide to help diagnose it?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003cbr\u003e\nOpen any existing Grok Bot in Cursor.\u003cbr\u003e\nSend a simple message such as: HEALTH CHECK — NO TOOLS, CONNECTORS, SEARCH OR MEMORY. Reply exactly: FORGE_ALIVE\u003cbr\u003e\nWait for the response.\u003cbr\u003e\nThe bot fails with: “Bot failed to respond — Something went wrong while generating the reply.”\u003cbr\u003e\nRestart Cursor/computer and repeat.\u003cbr\u003e\nCreate a fresh copy of the Grok Bot and repeat the same test.\u003cbr\u003e\nThe failure persists across both existing and newly created Grok Bots.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-480261-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-480261-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eloading any bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-480261-operating-system-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-480261-operating-system-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003cbr\u003e\nLinux\u003cbr\u003e\niOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-480261-version-information-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-480261-version-information-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003egrok bot   0.24\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-480261-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-480261-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes - Cursor is unusable\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-01T16:34:05.251Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":60,"reads":22,"readers_count":21,"score":304.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":170235,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond","display_username":"Tamas King","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-stuck-bot-failed-to-respond-on-every-message-all-bots/170328","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Grok Bot stuck: \"Bot failed to respond\" on every message, all bots","clicks":0},{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-0-43-0-bot-failed-to-respond-reset-agent-computer-stuck-in-partial-state/170661","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Grok Bot 0.43.0 — Bot failed to respond; Reset Agent Computer stuck in partial state","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":135615,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond/170235/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":480302,"name":"Ali Lakrakbi","username":"Ali_Lakrakbi","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/ali_lakrakbi/{size}/119432_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-01T17:12:12.027Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003esame here\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-01T17:12:12.027Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":16,"readers_count":15,"score":3.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170235,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond","display_username":"Ali Lakrakbi","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":135540,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond/170235/4","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":480491,"name":"Kevin Neilson","username":"kevinn","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kevinn/{size}/101206_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-01T22:39:41.682Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/tamas_king\"\u003e@Tamas_King\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ali_lakrakbi\"\u003e@Ali_Lakrakbi\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the reports.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe took a look at both of your accounts, and this isn’t something you can fix from your side. The cloud computer that runs all of your bots got into a stuck state, and since every bot (including fresh copies) runs on that same computer, they all fail the same way. That’s why restarting and creating a new bot didn’t help.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBoth of your computers have now been recovered on our end. Please fully quit Grok Bot (Cmd+Q on Mac, force-close on iOS), reopen it, and send a short test message in a new chat.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/tamas_king\"\u003e@Tamas_King\u003c/a\u003e, it looks like Grok Bot is signed in on several of your devices and at least one is on an older version. Please update every install to the latest version and keep just one open while you test.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf either of you still sees “Bot failed to respond” after that, reply here with the request ID from the error tray and we’ll take another look.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-01T22:39:41.682Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":12,"readers_count":11,"score":12.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":170235,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond","display_username":"Kevin Neilson","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":105146,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond/170235/8","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":481631,"name":"Corey Saxe","username":"Corey_Saxe","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/8e7dd6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-02T23:27:45.217Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSubject:\u003c/strong\u003e Grok Bot Agent “Failed to Send” - Cloud Computer Frozen (Buttons Greyed Out)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBody:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nHi team, my Grok Bot agent completely broke across both macOS and iOS with a “Failed to send” error.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMy chat history has vanished from the UI, so I cannot retrieve a Request ID. Under Settings \u0026gt; Updates, both the “Update” and “Reset Grok Bot’s Computer” buttons are completely greyed out and unclickable even after a hard log-out and clearing my local application support cache.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt appears my account’s dedicated cloud runner is deadlocked. Could an engineer please manually recover or rebuild the Agent Computer on the backend for my account?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMy Account Username / Registered Email:\u003c/strong\u003e [coreysaxe@gmail.com]\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":9,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-02T23:27:45.217Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":9,"readers_count":8,"score":16.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":170235,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond","display_username":"Corey Saxe","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":135819,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond/170235/9","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":481645,"name":"Corey Saxe","username":"Corey_Saxe","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/8e7dd6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-03T00:17:57.328Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI was able to get it to reset grok bot’s computer and all is good now!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":10,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-03T00:17:57.328Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":9,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":8,"readers_count":7,"score":51.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":170235,"topic_slug