lse,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","reply_to_user":{"id":135819,"username":"Corey_Saxe","name":"Corey Saxe","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/8e7dd6/{size}.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":105146,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond/170235/11","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":481688,"name":"Corey Saxe","username":"Corey_Saxe","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/8e7dd6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-03T01:16:27.563Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThank you!!!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":12,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-03T01:16:27.563Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":11,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":1.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170235,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond","display_username":"Corey Saxe","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":105146,"username":"kevinn","name":"Kevin Neilson","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kevinn/{size}/101206_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":135819,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond/170235/12","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":481734,"name":"Manoj","username":"Manoj1","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/e0b2c6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-03T02:31:53.594Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/kevinn\"\u003e@kevinn\u003c/a\u003e Same issue here, on both my laptop and my phone.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery time I open a bot it shows “Setting up your computer”, then it fails with \u003cstrong\u003e“Can’t reach your computer. Your bots are saved.”\u003c/strong\u003e with Retry and Recover computer buttons. Clicking either one does nothing - it goes straight back to the same “Can’t reach your computer” message every single time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHappens on \u003cstrong\u003eboth my laptop and my phone\u003c/strong\u003e on the same account, so it is not one device or one install.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eI have created several bots/agents - they are all saved, but none of them will connect.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRetry / Recover computer have never once worked.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo request ID available, since the message never gets sent.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBased on posts 8 and 10 above this looks like the same stuck cloud computer, and it does not seem fixable from my side. Could you please recover/rebuild the agent computer for my account on the backend?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccount email: \u003ca href=\"mailto:rajmanoj21@gmail.com\"\u003erajmanoj21@gmail.com\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThanks!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":13,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-03T02:31:53.594Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":170235,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond","display_username":"Manoj","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":135839,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond/170235/13","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":482047,"name":"Jawaz Illavia","username":"illavia","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/illavia/{size}/119077_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-03T09:17:32.704Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/kevinn\"\u003e@kevinn\u003c/a\u003e  - thank you for the info - mine failed this morning and I did a reset and recovered (tailscale had to be reinstalled).  I asked grok bot what happened and this was the reply:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe old VM is gone, so there’s no OOM crash dump left to prove it. What is left: this computer has 15 GB RAM, several agents each get their own desktop and Chrome, and even after a clean boot with almost no tabs it’s already using about 10 GB, with Chrome taking roughly 5 GB. A pile of leftover tabs on top of that would pin it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYour 6am brief didn’t fire until 10:01, so it was stuck for hours, not a momentary freeze.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ll close leftover login/admin tabs from this morning so we don’t start the same pile again.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":14,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-03T09:17:32.704Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":8,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":10.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":170235,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond","display_username":"Jawaz Illavia","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":105146,"username":"kevinn","name":"Kevin Neilson","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kevinn/{size}/101206_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":134961,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond/170235/14","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":484245,"name":"Ah Ah","username":"Ah_Ah","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/a87d85/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-05T22:07:07.919Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eSame issue here on Android.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery message to my existing bot fails with:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e**Bot failed to respond**\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSomething went wrong while generating the reply. Try again.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis happens on simple messages too, including “hello”, “Stop now”, and a new chat. Creating a new bot also fails with:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e**Could not create the Bot. Please try again.**\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Agent Computer itself still opens. I can see the desktop, a terminal at `box@cursor:/workspace`, and the Chrome icon. So the box is reachable, but the bot process never generates a reply.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat I already tried:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Force-stop the Android app and clear cache\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Sign out and sign back in\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Send Stop now / short test messages\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Tried creating a new bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Checked Settings on Android 1.5.0 — there is **no** Update / Recover / Reset Agent Computer option on mobile\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover / rebuild the Agent Computer for this account on the backend. I cannot reset it from the Android app.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAccount\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:chechuchka67@proton.me\"\u003echechuchka67@proton.me\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"mailto:chechuchka67@proton.me\"\u003echechuchka67@proton.me\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":15,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-05T22:07:07.919Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":11,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":1,"readers_count":0,"score":0.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170235,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-failed-to-respond","display_username":"Ah Ah","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":105146,"username":"kevinn","name":"Kevin Neilson","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/kevinn/{size}/101206_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136365,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"p